{"applicability_conditions":null,"identity":{"block_id":"b0109","equation_id":"equation_018","equation_number":"18","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n2 \\mathrm{Fe} ^ {3 +} + 3 \\mathrm{H} _ {2} \\mathrm{O} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{Fe} _ {2} \\mathrm{O} _ {3} + 6 \\mathrm{H} ^ {+}\\tag{18}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.corsci.2025.113331"},"latex":"2 \\mathrm{Fe} ^ {3 +} + 3 \\mathrm{H} _ {2} \\mathrm{O} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{Fe} _ {2} \\mathrm{O} _ {3} + 6 \\mathrm{H} ^ {+}","purpose":"描述 Fe³⁺ 离子与水发生水解/沉淀反应，生成 Fe₂O₃（氧化铁）并释放 H⁺（质子）的反应方程式。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"三价铁离子（ferric ion，铁(III)阳离子）","symbol":"Fe^{3+}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"水","symbol":"H_2O","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"氧化铁（iron(III) oxide，赤铁矿）","symbol":"Fe_2O_3","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"质子（氢离子）","symbol":"H^+","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["该式为水解/沉淀反应方程式；式中数字 2、3、6 为化学计量系数（配平系数）。","原文未给出 'where ...' 符号解释从句；相邻公式(16)(19)(20)为类似的金属离子水解生成氧化物/氢氧化物并释放 H⁺ 的反应。"]}